{
 "file": "06BLK07I base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:41",
   "ptr": "0x41",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「この街以外が全滅とあっては、宿屋も\\n",
   "en": "\"With every town but this one wiped out, I s'pose I'll have to close up the inn, eh? ...Well, that aside,",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:6a",
   "ptr": "0x6a",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  廃業せにゃなりませんかねェ？\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:41"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:8d",
   "ptr": "0x8d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　・・・ま、それはともかく、お泊まり\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:41"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:b6",
   "ptr": "0xb6",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  しますかい？」",
   "en": "will you be stayin' the night?\"",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:dc",
   "ptr": "0xdc",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「せっかく金を貯めたのに、《黒竜》の\\n",
   "en": "\"I saved up all that money, and thanks to the Black Dragon, look at me now! Dammit! I'm gonna spend every last coin before I die!",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:105",
   "ptr": "0x105",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  せいで、このザマだ！　くそ！\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:dc"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:128",
   "ptr": "0x128",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　死ぬ前に、全部、使いきってやる！\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:dc"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:150",
   "ptr": "0x150",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　とりあえず、この宿屋を買い取って、\\n",
   "en": "For starters, maybe I'll buy this inn and make it my home.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:179",
   "ptr": "0x179",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  我が家にできんものかな」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:150"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:19e",
   "ptr": "0x19e",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "「お金があるうちは、パパについてくわ」\\f",
   "en": "\"As long as there's money, I'll stick with Papa.\"",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:1cf",
   "ptr": "0x1cf",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「早く、落ち着いて商売できるようにな\\n",
   "en": "\"I wish things would settle down so we could do business in peace, eh.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:1f8",
   "ptr": "0x1f8",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  らないかねェ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:1cf"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:213",
   "ptr": "0x213",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「これからは、辺境の人たちとも、うま\\n",
   "en": "\"From now on, I suppose we'll have to get along with the frontier folk. If we're to survive, we need their special powers.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:23c",
   "ptr": "0x23c",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  くやっていかねばならんだろうな。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:213"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:263",
   "ptr": "0x263",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  生き残っていくためには、彼らの特殊\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:213"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:28c",
   "ptr": "0x28c",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  な力は必要だよ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:213"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:2a9",
   "ptr": "0x2a9",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "「なんだかねェ・・・\\n",
   "en": "\"Oh, I don't know... Living alongside folks who're practically monsters... I just don't know...\"",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:2c2",
   "ptr": "0x2c2",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　あたしゃ、魔物みたいな人たちと一緒\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:2a9"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:2eb",
   "ptr": "0x2eb",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  に暮らすのなんてねェ・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:2a9"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:319",
   "ptr": "0x319",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "「情報があるんだが、買わないか？\\n",
   "en": "\"I've got some information. Wanna buy it?",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:33e",
   "ptr": "0x33e",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "　２００Ｇでどうだ？」",
   "en": "How's 200G sound?\"",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:37f",
   "ptr": "0x37f",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "「金が足りないようだね」\\f",
   "en": "\"Looks like you're short on cash.\"",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:3a7",
   "ptr": "0x3a7",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "「まいど！\\n",
   "en": "\"Pleasure doing business! I'll only say this once, so listen good.",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:3b6",
   "ptr": "0x3b6",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　一度しか言わないから、よく聞いてく\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:3a7"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:3df",
   "ptr": "0x3df",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "  れ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:3a7"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:3eb",
   "ptr": "0x3eb",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　今、バルクルーサ城は黒竜の波動に覆\\n",
   "en": "Right now, Balkrutha Castle is covered by the Black Dragon's Wave. Nobody could get inside, but...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:414",
   "ptr": "0x414",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  われていて、とても中に入れる状態じゃ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:3eb"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:43f",
   "ptr": "0x43f",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  ないが・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:3eb"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:453",
   "ptr": "0x453",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　そうなる前に、何が起こったか・・・\\n",
   "en": "As for what happened before it got that way... I'll tell you what I heard from a guy who actually saw it.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:47c",
   "ptr": "0x47c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　実際に、見てきた奴の話を聞かせてや\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:453"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:4a5",
   "ptr": "0x4a5",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "  ろう。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:453"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:4b3",
   "ptr": "0x4b3",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　貴族の連中が残していったお宝を目当\\n",
   "en": "A guy who snuck in after the treasure the nobles left behind.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:4dc",
   "ptr": "0x4dc",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  てに入り込んだ奴の話さ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:4b3"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:4fc",
   "ptr": "0x4fc",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　貴族や兵士が逃げて行った後、どこか\\n",
   "en": "After the nobles and soldiers ran off, out of nowhere came a big hulk of a swordsman lugging a huge sword, and a black-haired woman dressed like a sorcerer.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:525",
   "ptr": "0x525",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  らともなく、でっかい剣をかかえた大\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:4fc"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:54e",
   "ptr": "0x54e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  男の剣士と、魔導師の姿をした黒髪の\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:4fc"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:577",
   "ptr": "0x577",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "  女が現れたそうだ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:4fc"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:591",
   "ptr": "0x591",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　そいつらが、何をやらかしたのかは知\\n",
   "en": "No idea what those two got up to, but right after that the Wave appeared and covered the castle.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:5ba",
   "ptr": "0x5ba",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  らないが、その後すぐに波動が現れて、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:591"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:5e5",
   "ptr": "0x5e5",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "  城を覆ってしまったらしい。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:591"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:607",
   "ptr": "0x607",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　また、不思議なことに、そいつら２人\\n",
   "en": "And here's the strange part: the pair of 'em seemed just fine inside the Wave.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:630",
   "ptr": "0x630",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  は波動の中でも平気な様子だったとい\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:607"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:659",
   "ptr": "0x659",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "  う。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:607"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:665",
   "ptr": "0x665",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  もしかしたら、何か特別な防具でも、\\n",
   "en": "Maybe they had some kind of special armor on...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:68e",
   "ptr": "0x68e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  身につけてたのかもしれないな・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:665"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:6b8",
   "ptr": "0x6b8",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　何にせよ、城が波動に覆われた原因は、\\n",
   "en": "Either way, looks like that man and woman are the reason the castle's covered by the Wave.",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:6e3",
   "ptr": "0x6e3",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "  その男と女にありそうだよ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:6b8"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:705",
   "ptr": "0x705",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　とりあえず、情報は今のところこれだ\\n",
   "en": "Anyway, that's all the info I've got for now.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:72e",
   "ptr": "0x72e",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "  けだ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:705"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:73e",
   "ptr": "0x73e",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "「情報も無しにウロウロする気かい？\\n",
   "en": "\"Gonna wander around without any info? Well, suit yourself.\"",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:765",
   "ptr": "0x765",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　まあ、それもいいけどね」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:73e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:787",
   "ptr": "0x787",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「いい情報があれば買うよ。また来てく\\n",
   "en": "\"I'll buy good info if you've got any. Come again.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:7b0",
   "ptr": "0x7b0",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "  れ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:787"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:7c2",
   "ptr": "0x7c2",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "「もう、起きる気力が無いわい」\\f",
   "en": "\"I ain't got the strength to get up anymore, I tell you.\"",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:7eb",
   "ptr": "0x7eb",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「貴族がいなくなって、自由になったの\\n",
   "en": "\"With the nobles gone, are we free now, or has everything just gone to pieces... I can't make heads or tails of it.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:814",
   "ptr": "0x814",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  か、めちゃくちゃになったのか・・・\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:7eb"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:83d",
   "ptr": "0x83d",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　あたしゃ、なんだかわかんないよ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK07I:7eb"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK07I:872",
   "ptr": "0x872",
